          "_type": "Expr",
          "_fields": {
            "value": {
              "_type": "Constant",
              "_fields": {
                "value": "\nHop 5: Comprehensive Validation - HIGH-SIGNAL OVERWRITE\n\nThis advanced validator uses the HOP-0 RAG analysis as a\nground-truth \"answer key\" to validate the final generated content\nfrom the HOP-4 staging buffer.\n\nIt performs:\n1.  Semantic Alignment Validation (Vector-based)\n2.  Thematic & Keyword Coverage Checks\n3.  Narrative Inclusion Checks\n4.  Standard Linting & Placeholder Detection\n",
                "kind": "None"
              },
              "_lineno": 2,
              "_col_offset": 0
            }
          },
          "_lineno": 2,
          "_col_offset": 0
        },
